  <!-- EN: When enabled, defenders will stay inside their base to eat and rest, and will never assault or chase intruders into vacuum. When disabled, they will defend the base and then assault, as in vanilla.\nSettlement garrisons need the custom settlement map generator for this. The smuggler's den garrison does not.\nThis is decided when a map is generated, so it will only affect maps you enter afterwards. -->
